WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.380
Qatar used to be one of the poorest countries&nbsp;
in the world, and now it's one of the richest.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:08.220
So how on earth did that happen? Back in&nbsp;
the day, most Qataris were part of nomadic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:12.180
tribes like the Bedouin. Everyone else in the&nbsp;
country basically lived in fishing villages,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:17.040
and the biggest industry was pearl hunting.&nbsp;
Pearl hunting is like insanely dangerous and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:21.420
exhausting work. In the heat of the summer, these&nbsp;
men would row their boats out to the open ocean,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:24.840
they would put wooden clips around their&nbsp;
nose, and they would tie themselves to a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:28.980
rock and then jump into the ocean for minutes&nbsp;
at a time to collect oysters. They would come&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:32.940
up and hope that there were pearls in them. The&nbsp;
pearl industry eventually got crushed. World War&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:39.180
I happened. And then in 1939, everything changed&nbsp;
when oil was discovered. Qatar hit the fossil fuel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:43.800
jackpot not just with oil, but also when they&nbsp;
discovered that they literally are sitting on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:48.540
the world's largest natural gas field. So,&nbsp;
yeah, thanks to the Industrial Revolution,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:53.040
everything changed. And now Qatar's rich&nbsp;
as $%#@ I mean, just look at their cities.

